### API Gateway REST API Tests
### Gateway Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Variables
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@restaurantId = RESTAURANT-001
@customerId = 1

###############################################
# Gateway Health Check
###############################################

### Gateway Health
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### Gateway Info
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/info

### Gateway Routes (if enabled)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/gateway/routes

###############################################
# Catalog Service via Gateway
###############################################

### Get Menu via Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/catalog/menu/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Featured Items via Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/catalog/menu/{{restaurantId}}/featured
Accept: application/json

### Search Menu via Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/catalog/menu/{{restaurantId}}/search?query=pizza
Accept: application/json

###############################################
# Order Service via Gateway
###############################################

### Create Order via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "orderType": "DELIVERY",
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Gateway Test St",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "test-id",
      "menuItemName": "Test Pizza",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 15.99
    }
  ]
}

### Get Customer Orders via Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders/customer/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

