###############################################
# Notes
###############################################

# API Gateway Features:
# - Service Discovery (routes via Eureka)
# - Rate Limiting (Redis-based)
# - Circuit Breakers (Resilience4j)
# - OAuth2 JWT validation (Keycloak)
# - Request/Response logging

# Rate Limits:
# - Catalog: 10 req/s, burst 20
# - Orders: 10 req/s, burst 20
# - Kitchen: 10 req/s, burst 20
# - Payments: 5 req/s, burst 10
# - Inventory: 10 req/s, burst 20

# Circuit Breaker Config:
# - Sliding window: 10 requests
# - Failure threshold: 50%
# - Wait in open state: 10 seconds
# - Half-open calls: 3

# How to test:
# 1. Start all infrastructure
# 2. Start discovery-service
# 3. Start api-gateway
# 4. Start backend services (catalog, order, etc.)
# 5. All requests should go through port 8080
